  "title": "Awards & Recognitions – Do they help us Design for Sustainability?",
  "summary": "Every year, sustainability teams spend countless hours responding to ESG ratings, rankings, indices, awards, and assessments. It's fair to ask: is this effort worthwhile? As someone who has spent years navigating these frameworks, my answer is: sometimes. The business world has no shortage of sustainability badges, accolades, and scorecards. Some create more noise than value. [...]",
